The hi.*.svg icon artwork is copied from the Mobius Apple client or directly
from Hugeicons Core Free Icons, preserving the official path data.
The hi.*.fill.svg variants are first-party filled edits of those Hugeicons paths
(made under the same MIT License), and bot.face.line.svg is the outline twin of the
first-party Bot face.

