Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub
Licensed under the MIT License reproduced above.
Source: https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/blob/c385b2b8d1f9e19aa86e628d4e23c91ee1111a47/packages/static-svg/icons/openrouter.svg
